{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109060","id":2701861354,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6hCyHq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109060","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109060.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109060.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109060","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109060/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109060/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109060/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/20a308b60ef22d62422a97a40b0ff02415f307e0","number":109060,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add inspector Locking System","user":{"login":"aman-batra-dev","id":85820409,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODIwNDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85820409?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/aman-batra-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aman-batra-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This pull request introduces a new Inspector Locking System to the Godot Editor. It enables developers to lock the Inspector to a specific node, allowing them to interact with other nodes or perform operations in the scene without losing reference to the previously inspected node's properties.\r\n\r\nAll additions have been clearly marked in the ```editor/inspector/editor_inspector.cpp``` using the following format:\r\n```CPP\r\n// <Code Title>\r\n...\r\n// End\r\n```\r\n\r\nFeatures Implemented\r\n\r\n1. Inspector Lock Button\r\n      -  A new toggle button has been added to the Inspector panel.\r\n      -  Once enabled, it locks the Inspector to the currently selected node.\r\n\r\n2. Dynamic Icon Feedback\r\n      -  The button changes its icon color to green when locked and white when unlocked.\r\n      -  This provides immediate visual feedback to the user.\r\n\r\n3. Property Editing in Lock State\r\n      -  While locked, the Inspector continues to reflect and apply property changes to the locked node, even if the user selects or\r\ninteracts with other nodes in the scene.\r\n\r\n4. Safe Cleanup on Node Deletion\r\n     -  If the locked node is deleted, the system automatically unlocks the Inspector and clears the stale reference, preventing memory leaks and engine freezes.\r\n\r\n5. Non-intrusive Scene Interactions\r\n      -  Interacting with other nodes (e.g., changing transforms, deleting them, etc.) does not affect the state of the locked Inspector or the locked node.\r\n\r\n6. Graceful Unlocking\r\n      -  Upon unlocking, the Inspector immediately reflects the currently selected node’s properties, resuming normal behavior seamlessly.\r\n      \r\n\r\n\r\nTesting:-\r\n1. The feature was built and tested in a local fork of Godot's GDScript version (Haven't tried with the mono version yet).\r\n2. Multiple edge cases were accounted for.\r\n3. No memory leaks, crashes, or freezes observed after the latest patch.\r\n\r\nFor the demo video of the feature, check this out: https://youtu.be/NV9M_Ofev1A","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock